hilde (1.1.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Added linter to hilde check and the language server.
  * Added Standard.Array and Standard.ArrayCompute.
  * Added linear algebra via BLIS and LAPACK.
  * Added Standard.Bits.
  * Added hilde rename and hilde check --fix.
  * Added formatting and quick fixes to the language server.
  * Added cross builds via zig cc.
  * Added tasks in libraries.
  * Added SPERLI collectives, checkpoints and libsperli.
  * Runtime prelude split into parts.

 -- Heiko Zimmermann <code@heiko-zimmermann.com>  Sun,  8 Nov 2026 22:00:00 +0100

hilde (1.0.0) stable; urgency=low

  * First stable release.
  * Added pattern matching, error kinds and the type Never.
  * Added contracts.
  * Added hilde check, fmt, lsp, test, guard and query.
  * Added the package manager hilde-pkg.
  * Added editor support for tree-sitter, Zed, VS Code, Vim and Emacs.
  * Added SPERLI.
  * Added tasks on fibers.
  * Added OS sandbox.
  * Added WebAssembly, static and shared libraries as targets.
  * Added support for iOS and Android.
  * Added Raft and replicated SQLite.
  * Added Regex, Pcre, Json, Csv, Toml, Ini, Yaml, Xml, Cbor and Decimal.
  * Added SQLite, SQLCipher, PostgreSQL, MariaDB, DuckDB and full-text
    search.
  * Added Tls, HttpClient, FastCGI, Smtp, Sftp, Htmx and templates.
  * Added cookies, sessions, CSRF tokens, users and vault.
  * Added libcrypto with ML-DSA, X.509, ACME, JWS, COSE, OTP and Argon2.
  * Added Arguments, Log, Calendar, Unicode, Gzip, Graph, PNG, QR codes
    and translations.
  * Added support for Linux, OpenBSD, FreeBSD and macOS.

 -- Heiko Zimmermann <code@heiko-zimmermann.com>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 22:00:00 +0100

